{"availability":"available","full":"mateolafalce/iron-within","name":"iron-within","description":"Real-time cinematic color grade for the whole Cinnamon desktop. Toggle with the panel icon or Super+G. The GLSL grade and sharpen pass run inside Muffin and do not change the monitor ICC profile.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-02T13:38:02Z","updated":"2026-10-02T21:25:10Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.youtube.com/@IronnWithin","topics":["cinnamon","cinnamon-applet","color-grading","glsl","linux-desktop","muffin","opengl","shader","x11"],"demo":null,"color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Cinematic Grade is a real-time color filter for the whole Cinnamon desktop. Normal use is a panel icon, a hooded figure. One click turns the grade on. Another click turns the grade off. The gesture is the same as Desaturate All. While the grade is on, the same figure takes a teal grade.","Super+G does the same action. The grade starts off.","The filter does not change the monitor ICC profile, gamma ramps, or colord."],"features":["picom: Muffin already composites the screen. A second compositor cannot apply a shader to that same screen.","vkBasalt or Gamescope: These tools affect only one Vulkan application, or one game.","xrandr, redshift, gamma: Each tool is one ramp per channel. There is no S-curve, no luminance tint, no sharpen, and no vignette. These tools also replace the monitor color path.","3D LUT on the CPU: The LUT reads the framebuffer and paints it again. This adds latency. The LUT stays outside the compositor."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mateolafalce/iron-within/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"053a6f7b18b5d9b475c8f575de3f4280ccc8dd9e91bebed4307c5f0fb80a986d","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Cinematic Grade is a real-time color filter for the whole Cinnamon desktop. Normal use is a panel icon, a hooded figure. One click turns the grade on. Another click turns the grade off. The gesture is the same as Desaturate All. While the grade is on, the same figure takes a teal grade.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mateolafalce/iron-within/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"053a6f7b18b5d9b475c8f575de3f4280ccc8dd9e91bebed4307c5f0fb80a986d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mateolafalce/iron-within/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T21:25:10Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mateolafalce/iron-within/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","hash":"053a6f7b18b5d9b475c8f575de3f4280ccc8dd9e91bebed4307c5f0fb80a986d","originalBytes":16057,"storedBytes":16057,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["grade","applet","does","one","sharpen","cinnamon","mateo","panel","same","when","grain","icon","off.","value","iron-within","muffin","off","script","click","shader","bin","change","extension","press","shortcut","stays","only","cinematic-grade","color","dev","exposure","file","home","iron-within-panel","preset","still","these","turn","window","bash","both","cinematic","desktop","effect","fullscreen","gamma","group","key","pass","runs","shell","starts","there","tint","uses","vignette","while","adds","again.","alpha","already","each","every","gnome","gradeengine.js","gradelogic.js","install.sh","mint","per","presets.json","run","screen.","shaders","teal","tests","turns","another","before","compositor","contrast","desaturate","desktop.","filter","luminance","lut","must","percent","previous"